<title>BELGIUM: Oilseeds grooup joins COCERAL.</title>
<headline>Oilseeds grooup joins COCERAL.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANGO, the European association of oilseeds, olive oils, oils and fats, and UCEPCE, the umbrella group representing the fertiliser and pesticide trade have joined COCERAL, the EU cereals umbrella organisation.</p>
<p>In a statement issued on Tuesday, Coceral said that the organisation now represents trade in all arable crops, olive oil and agro-suppliers.</p>
<p>The full name of the organisation has been changed and is now &quot;the Committee of cereals, oilseeds, animal feed, olive oil, oil and fats and agrosupply trade in the EU,&quot; COCERAL said.</p>
</text>
